        <title>不眠夜(也多少眠了一点)</title>
        <link>https://YGPNFOREVER.github.io/p/%E4%B8%8D%E7%9C%A0%E5%A4%9C%E4%B9%9F%E5%A4%9A%E5%B0%91%E7%9C%A0%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E7%82%B9/</link>
